 # ── FRIENDS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 L('friends', "Eldon Keyward", "An elf scholar who specializes in the Outer Planes, kidnapped in Neverwinter.", "A cult captive; dragged into Evernight with the party, where his planar knowledge helps them find the way home."),
