 L('friends', "Vaeve", "A drow mage on Pandesmos, loyal to neither Lolth nor Kas.", "Offers the party information: where Miska is, who directs Lolth's troops, and that a vampire gives Miska orders."),
 L('friends', "Mordenkainen", "A legendary archmage of Oerth, famous across the multiverse.", "The real one is off travelling the multiverse and has no idea someone is wearing his face. Kas has clashed with him before."),

 # ── FOES ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 L('foes', "Vecna", "The Whispered One: a lich who became a god of secrets and magic.", "The final villain. Weakened while weaving the Ritual of Remaking in the Cave of Shattered Reflection. Banished to Oerth if the party wins; far from undone."),
