 L('foes', "Miska the Wolf-Spider", "A demon lord imprisoned eons ago by the Wind Dukes of Aaqa.", "Kas's ally against Vecna. Kas uses the rod to tear a hole in his prison; Miska is widening it from the Ruinous Citadel."),
 L('foes', "Lolth", "The Spider Queen, demon goddess of the drow.", "Vecna's ally. Her forces, under Camlash, fight Miska's on Pandesmos."),
