 L('foes', "Tiamat", "Queen of Evil Dragons, five-headed, whose lair lies in Avernus.", "She holds the seventh piece. Tell her about Vecna's plan and she lets the party take it, because the Material Plane is partly her creation (guide). Act II link: her banishment upset the giant gods."),
 L('foes', "Windfall", "The ostentatious, charismatic host of the Red Belvedere, glittering with multicoloured scales and a shimmering tailcoat.", "Tiamat's champion; her blade sings with all five chromatic elements. Defeat her or convince her to surrender the piece."),
 L('foes', "The Lord of Blades", "A warforged warlord of the Mournland.", "Worshipped by his blades; his strike squad races the party for Landro."),
 L('foes', "Hertilod", "A skinless, serpentine, lizardlike thing born from a dead god's corpse.", "Swallowed the second rod piece and retreated into the Heart of Havock."),

